Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A good therapist
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.76,0:00:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,knows what they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.38,0:00:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,don't know,
