Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.43,0:00:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,they're going to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.77,0:00:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.07,0:00:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I always say
