Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.97,0:00:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,God is God
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.71,0:00:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,knows he's not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.27,0:00:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,a surgeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.37,0:00:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
